1662		projector of the following projective measurement: measure all $M$
1663		qudits in the basis $W$, obtaining an outcome $h \in \F_q^{M}$, and
1664		return the polynomial $f''$ obtained by substituting the
1665		parameterization of $\ell$ into the low-degree encoding
1666		$g_h \colon \F_q^m \to \F_q$
1667		(see Definition~\ref{def:low-degree-encoding}): writing $(u_0,v)$ for
